          }
        ],
        "text": "Justices Alito, Kagan, and Gorsuch asked questions about the scope of \u00a713(b) and the practicality of granting monetary relief."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Commission and Petitioners",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "a3b3061f560bff34209f0327909e0cdbe408ebd589948ddcabc85e3290b54835",
            "evidence_ids": [
